# ------------------------------------------------------------
# توليد مفاتيح آمنة (Commands)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# JWT_SECRET (48 chars):
#   openssl rand -base64 48 | tr -d '\n'
#   # أو: node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(48).toString('base64'))"

# CRON_SECRET (32 chars):
#   openssl rand -base64 32 | tr -d '\n'

# ADMIN_PASSWORD (قوي، 16+ chars):
#   openssl rand -base64 24 | tr -d '\n'
#   # أو استخدم: https://bitwarden.com/password-generator/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Google OAuth Setup
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials
# 2. Create Credentials → OAuth 2.0 Client ID → Web application
# 3. Authorized redirect URIs:
#    https://ibrheamkhalaf88-collab.github.io/GymOS/auth/drive-callback.html
#    https://mwfbgucayjgbbvcyelbo.functions.supabase.co/gymos-drive-backup/oauth/callback
#    http://localhost:5173/auth/drive-callback.html (للتصحيح المحلي)
# 4. Enable APIs: Google Drive API
# 5. نسخ Client ID و Client Secret

